{"seq":3,"slug":"last-mile-delivery","title":"大学物流管理 — 最后一公里配送","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/transportation-distribution/last-mile-delivery","wordCount":1643,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学物流管理-最后一公里配送\">大学物流管理 — 最后一公里配送</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>&quot;最后一公里&quot;（Last Mile Delivery）指物流链条的最末端——从最后一个配送节点（站点、网点）把货物送到最终收件人手中的那一段。它距离短，却是整个物流中<strong>成本最高、效率最低、体验最关键</strong>的一环。研究表明，最后一公里的成本可占整个配送链条的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%\\sim50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>，是物流降本的&quot;最后堡垒&quot;。</p>\n<p>为什么最短的一段反而最贵？因为它失去了规模经济。干线运输可以一车拉几十吨集中运输，而最后一公里是&quot;一个包裹送一个地址&quot;，高度分散、单点小批量，配送员要爬楼、等电梯、找门牌、应对客户不在家——这些都是难以摊薄的人力成本。电商越发达，包裹越零碎、时效要求越高，最后一公里的压力就越大。</p>\n<p>破解最后一公里，行业演化出了多种模式：快递柜与代收点（自提）、众包配送（如骑手抢单）、前置仓（即时零售）、以及无人配送（无人机、配送机器人）。本课将逐一剖析这些创新背后的经济逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"为什么最后一公里这么贵-成本结构\">为什么最后一公里这么贵：成本结构</h3><p>干线与末端的成本对比，根源在于&quot;集约 vs. 分散&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>单位成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>干线运输</td>\n<td>大批量、长距离、集约</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域分拨</td>\n<td>中批量、中距离</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最后一公里</td>\n<td>单件、短距离、分散</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个配送员一天可能只能送 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\sim200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 个包裹，大量时间花在路上、楼道、等待客户。每个包裹分摊的人力成本居高不下。再加上&quot;配送不成功&quot;——客户不在家导致二次、三次投递，成本进一步飙升。所以最后一公里的核心矛盾是：<strong>如何在分散的末端重新找回一点&quot;规模&quot;和&quot;确定性&quot;</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"几种破解模式\">几种破解模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[最后一公里方案] --&gt; B[自提模式: 快递柜/代收点]&#10;    A --&gt; C[众包配送: 骑手抢单]&#10;    A --&gt; D[前置仓: 仓库前置到社区]&#10;    A --&gt; E[无人配送: 无人机/机器人]\">graph TD\n    A[最后一公里方案] --&gt; B[自提模式: 快递柜/代收点]\n    A --&gt; C[众包配送: 骑手抢单]\n    A --&gt; D[前置仓: 仓库前置到社区]\n    A --&gt; E[无人配送: 无人机/机器人]</pre><p><strong>1. 自提模式（快递柜、菜鸟驿站）</strong>：把&quot;送到手&quot;变成&quot;客户自取&quot;，配送员一次在柜机/驿站集中投放几十上百件，用&quot;客户多走几步&quot;换回了规模效应，大幅降低单件成本。代价是牺牲了部分体验（客户要自己取）。丰巢、菜鸟驿站是典型代表。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 众包配送（达达、闪送、外卖骑手）</strong>：不养固定车队，而是把订单众包给社会化的骑手，按单计酬。优点是弹性极强——高峰多人接单、低谷无成本，特别适合波动剧烈的即时配送。这是美团、饿了么的核心运力模式。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 前置仓（即时零售）</strong>：把仓库&quot;前置&quot;到离消费者最近的社区，使配送半径缩短到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 公里以内，从而实现&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟达&quot;。盒马、叮咚买菜、美团闪购都靠前置仓做生鲜即时配送。它本质是用更多的仓储成本换取极致的时效——又一个效益背反。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 无人配送</strong>：无人机（适合偏远、孤岛、应急）和配送机器人（适合园区、社区）试图用机器替代人力。京东、美团都在试点无人配送车，在封闭园区和特定路段已有应用，但大规模商用仍受法规、安全、成本制约。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个经济性对比示例\">一个经济性对比示例</h3><p>假设某区域日均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 个包裹，比较两种末端模式的人力成本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>上门派送</strong>：每名配送员日送 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 件，需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil 500/150 \\rceil = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\">500/150</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 人，按日薪 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 元计，日人力成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1200</span></span></span></span></span> 元，单件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span> 元。</li>\n<li><strong>快递柜投放</strong>：每名配送员日投 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 件（无需等客户、爬楼少），需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>300</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil 500/300 \\rceil = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\">500/300</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 人，日人力成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span> 元，加快递柜租金分摊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span> 元/件即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 元，合计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span></span></span></span></span> 元，单件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span></span></span></span></span> 元。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可见快递柜模式把单件成本从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span> 元降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span></span></span></span></span> 元，节省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33%</span></span></span></span></span>。这就是快递柜模式风靡的经济动因——尽管它牺牲了&quot;送货上门&quot;的体验，引发过不少争议。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时效与成本的终极权衡\">时效与成本的终极权衡</h3><p>最后一公里浓缩了整个物流的核心矛盾：<strong>更快 vs. 更省</strong>。&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟达&quot;体验极佳，但前置仓密布、骑手专送的成本高昂；快递柜自提便宜，却让用户多走一步。没有完美方案，企业要根据品类（生鲜要快、日用品可慢）、客群（年轻人接受自提、老人需要上门）做差异化设计。理解了这一点，你就理解了为什么同一个包裹，有人愿意等三天免运费，有人愿意加钱半小时达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为什么&quot;最后一公里&quot;这段距离最短，成本却最高？用&quot;规模经济&quot;的概念解释。</li>\n<li>快递柜模式如何重新找回规模效应？它牺牲了什么？你支持还是反对快递员&quot;未经同意放快递柜&quot;？</li>\n<li>前置仓实现&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟达&quot;靠的是什么？它体现了哪个贯穿全课程的核心权衡？</li>\n<li>用本课的成本对比方法，估算：若某区域日均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span> 件，上门派送每人日送 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 件、众包骑手每单提成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 元，两种方式的日成本各是多少？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《即时配送行业研究报告》——了解美团、达达的运力模式与单位经济</li>\n<li>搜索&quot;前置仓 盈利模型&quot;，看叮咚买菜、每日优鲜的成败启示</li>\n<li>关注丰巢快递柜的收费争议，思考末端便利与用户体验的边界</li>\n<li>了解亚马逊 Prime Air 无人机、京东无人配送车的最新进展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本课剖析了物流的&quot;最后堡垒&quot;——最后一公里。它因失去规模经济而成本最高（占配送成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%\\sim50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>），核心矛盾是如何在分散的末端找回规模与确定性。四大破解模式各有取舍：自提（快递柜/驿站）用便利换成本，众包配送用弹性应对波动，前置仓用仓储成本换极致时效，无人配送用机器替代人力。所有方案最终都落在&quot;更快 vs. 更省&quot;的权衡上。至此第三章完成。下一章我们将把视野拉高到整条供应链，看物流如何借助协同与信息技术升级为竞争优势。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学物流管理 — 最后一公里配送","id":"大学物流管理-最后一公里配送"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么最后一公里这么贵：成本结构","id":"为什么最后一公里这么贵-成本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"几种破解模式","id":"几种破解模式"},{"level":3,"text":"一个经济性对比示例","id":"一个经济性对比示例"},{"level":3,"text":"时效与成本的终极权衡","id":"时效与成本的终极权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学物流管理 — 车辆路径规划","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/transportation-distribution/vehicle-routing"},"next":{"title":"大学物流管理 — 供应链协同","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/modern-logistics-tech/supply-chain-coordination"}}